// engine.js — Python AST Support Checker & Step-by-Step Execution Engine
// Supports DSA patterns: tuple unpacking (`left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1`), array swaps,
// list item assignments (`arr[i] = x`), top-level functions (`def binary_search(arr, target):`),
// and `class Solution:` methods.

